Simple Linux Kernel module that finds a process and outputs the process memory. 

main_kernel.c is currently confiure for "firefox" but any process can be put in here manually


To Build
---------
Simple naviagte to the directory root and build with make
    make

To Clean
    make clean

To Load & Run Linux Kernel Module
    insmod main_kernel.ko

To unload Linux Kernel Module
    rmmod main_kernel.ko

To View Process Memory Dump use
    dmesg or the kernel log